<!doctype lake><title>Generative Models III</title><meta name="reading-minutes" content="31"><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="yfKpI" id="yfKpI"><span data-lake-id="u58231d38" id="u58231d38">🕊️</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6f3e808" id="ub6f3e808"> 𝐃𝐞𝐧𝐨𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐏𝐫𝐨𝐛𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="u3ea582db" id="u3ea582db"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22cd0f67" id="u22cd0f67" style="color: #70000D">扩散概率模型定义</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u569a22b6" id="u569a22b6">：一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d7dadc0" id="u8d7dadc0">经过参数化的马尔可夫链</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u89876ebc" id="u89876ebc">，通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua684a83d" id="ua684a83d">变分推断</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u642a1378" id="u642a1378">进行训练，使其在有限步采样后生成与真实数据分布一致的样本。该模型包含两个方向相反的过程</span></p><ul list="u557353c5"><li fid="u6886f7a8" data-lake-id="ud4f344c6" id="ud4f344c6"><span data-lake-id="u3bf2c0f0" id="u3bf2c0f0">其一是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5a52c58" id="uc5a52c58">前向扩散过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u973634e9" id="u973634e9">，即一个固定的马尔可夫链，按照给定方差调度逐步向数据中加入高斯噪声，直到原始信号基本被破坏</span></li><li fid="u6886f7a8" data-lake-id="u6f6bb0e0" id="u6f6bb0e0"><span data-lake-id="u547f50c2" id="u547f50c2">其二是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uff78dfa6" id="uff78dfa6">反向生成过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf3a6ca92" id="uf3a6ca92">，即学习一个从纯噪声逐步恢复样本的马尔可夫链，用来逆转前向加噪过程</span></li><li fid="u6886f7a8" data-lake-id="u20df1282" id="u20df1282"><span data-lake-id="uc55b3f18" id="uc55b3f18">当每一步扩散只加入较小的高斯噪声时，反向过程的转移也可以设为条件高斯分布，因此能够采用非常简洁的神经网络参数化形式。训练时，模型优化负对数似然的变分上界。而在特定的噪声预测参数化下，这一目标又可写成与多噪声层级 denoising score matching 相似的形式，并使采样过程呈现出 annealed Langevin dynamics 的解释</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubca46574" id="ubca46574"><strong><span data-lake-id="u935b6bfb" id="u935b6bfb" style="color: #70000D">DDPM 结合噪声预测与加权变分训练，实现逐步去噪生成</span></strong></p><ul list="uf04615ed"><li fid="uee8f34c0" data-lake-id="u6bfac2aa" id="u6bfac2aa"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a5a86bc" id="u1a5a86bc">高质量生成能力验证</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9565d82b" id="u9565d82b">：论文证明扩散模型能够生成与 GAN、自回归模型、流模型及 EBM 等主流方法相竞争的高质量样本，并在 CIFAR-10 上取得 9.46 的 IS 和 3.17 的 FID，确立扩散模型作为强生成范式的地位</span></li><li fid="uee8f34c0" data-lake-id="u16cb9398" id="u16cb9398"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8c7d05c" id="ua8c7d05c">扩散与 DSM/Langevin 的统一联系</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc61646b7" id="uc61646b7">：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4824f0b0" id="u4824f0b0" style="color: #00346B">论文建立扩散模型与 denoising score matching、annealed Langevin dynamics 之间的明确桥梁</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11ea7f61" id="u11ea7f61">，并提出基于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3d3af9d" id="ua3d3af9d">噪声预测</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u22a288a2" id="u22a288a2">与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u407a4c44" id="u407a4c44">加权变分下界</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue339dfad" id="ue339dfad">的实用训练方式</span></li><li fid="uee8f34c0" data-lake-id="u442850a5" id="u442850a5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf8a6101a" id="uf8a6101a">渐进式生成/压缩解释</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua5d59558" id="ua5d59558">：论文提出扩散采样可以理解为一种由粗到细的渐进式解码过程，即先恢复全局结构，再补充局部细节；从压缩角度看，这相当于一种有损到无损的渐进编码，也可被视为对自回归解码的广义推广，从而解释样本观感强但似然不占优的现象</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uad3115a7" id="uad3115a7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A841.102294921875%2C%22height%22%3A150.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1025%2C%22originHeight%22%3A183%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22PxQMI%22%7D" data-asset="assets/1c0f6865afd90b75a472bc20aaf03f34.png"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="mS8z5" id="mS8z5"><span data-lake-id="ub85a6f2b" id="ub85a6f2b">🐦</span><span data-lake-id="u81552b83" id="u81552b83"> 𝑩𝒂𝒄𝒌𝒈𝒓𝒐𝒖𝒏𝒅</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u19c78a7f" id="u19c78a7f"><span data-lake-id="ub2b1c28c" id="ub2b1c28c">1️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u64846b5f" id="u64846b5f"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uef1b8af8" id="uef1b8af8">扩散模型本质上是一类潜变量生成模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u65347e82" id="u65347e82">，其概率形式表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eprQq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0)%3A%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%5C%5C%2Cdx_%7B1%3AT%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u604069ad" id="u604069ad">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UlSpg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50e8fadf" id="u50e8fadf">表示与观测数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zQdpL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50f6471d" id="u50f6471d">维度相同的一系列潜变量。模型的联合分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bbF8c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u74237b9f" id="u74237b9f">通常称为反向生成过程，其被建模为一个带有可学习高斯转移核的马尔可夫链，并从各向同性高斯先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XoChq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(x_T)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_T%3B0%2CI)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58d78160" id="u58d78160">开始，逐步恢复出目标数据样本</span></p><p data-lake-id="u85c089d9" id="u85c089d9" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="1"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hITUQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20%3A%3D%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5CSigma%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t))%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-1">(1)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u16e62f06" id="u16e62f06"><span data-lake-id="u685cb90e" id="u685cb90e">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u3035821a" id="u3035821a"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubd74b511" id="ubd74b511">扩散模型区别于其他潜变量模型的关键在于，其近似后验分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kfpEe%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b6b407e" id="u2b6b407e">是预先固定的</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u71a1694b" id="u71a1694b">；该分布被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb5044ec" id="ubb5044ec">前向过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u284938f7" id="u284938f7">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc76b6ade" id="uc76b6ade">扩散过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u06da6455" id="u06da6455">。具体而言，它被设定为一个马尔可夫链，并按照给定的方差调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wAGL8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cbeta_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uad7c1242" id="uad7c1242">，逐步向原始数据中加入高斯噪声  </span></p><p data-lake-id="ue5ec11ac" id="ue5ec11ac" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="2"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PHEkO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-2">(2)</span></p><p data-lake-id="uceb9d33a" id="uceb9d33a"><span data-lake-id="u220708ef" id="u220708ef">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u45e4df0c" id="u45e4df0c"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb9cfa69" id="ucb9cfa69" data-lake-style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4),rgb(243, 48, 171)" style="color: rgb(255, 111, 4)">模型训练通过优化关于负对数似然的标准变分上界来进行，即把直接最小化负对数似然，换成最小化它的一个可计算上界</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0f747b17" id="u0f747b17"></span></p><p data-lake-id="u42ed0bd0" id="u42ed0bd0" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="3"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aXBLX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cleq%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%5C%5Cgeq%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%3D%3A%20L%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-3">(3)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufda810c0" id="ufda810c0" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="4"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IkrJt%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Balign%7D%5CnL%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%5C%5Cgeq%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E%201%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bp_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5Cleft%5BD_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5C%7C%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T))%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E1%7D%20D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5C%7C%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t))%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Balign%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-4">(4)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub6a9714d" id="ub6a9714d"><span data-lake-id="u23db5f74" id="u23db5f74">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ucdcb0d92" id="ucdcb0d92"> 前向过程中的方差参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tbCrG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufdc360ef" id="ufdc360ef">可以通过重参数化方法进行学习，也可以作为超参数保持固定。反向过程的表达能力在一定程度上由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22g5GnX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a238b64" id="u3a238b64">中采用高斯条件分布这一选择所保证，因为当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22H7QQ5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua25ba0f8" id="ua25ba0f8">足够小时，前向过程与反向过程具有相同的函数形式。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u390fe60e" id="u390fe60e" style="color: #00346B">前向过程的一个显著性质在于，它允许在任意时间步</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eqgVD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uec987e1f" id="uec987e1f" style="color: #00346B">以闭式形式对</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22H6D6J%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%22%7D" style="color: #00346B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u69483b89" id="u69483b89" style="color: #00346B">进行采样</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2bcc5f50" id="u2bcc5f50" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="5"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YKcbm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%20%3A%3D%201%20-%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bs%3D1%7D%5E%7Bt%7D%20%5C%5Calpha_s.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-5">(5)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8dede72e" id="u8dede72e" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PMMBh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cn%5C%5Cboxed%7Bq(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20%7C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-6">(6)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u557539e9" id="u557539e9"><span data-lake-id="ue64743be" id="ue64743be">5️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="udd3df095" id="udd3df095"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u93f8f6ac" id="u93f8f6ac" style="color: #101E60">前向后验具有闭式高斯形式，所有 KL 散度项都变成高斯分布之间的比较</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue06245fd" id="ue06245fd">，从而可以采用 Rao-Blackwellized 的方式，通过闭式表达式直接计算，而无需使用高方差的 Monte Carlo 估计</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue0a0302f" id="ue0a0302f" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="7"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JLK29%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5Cparallel%20p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T))%7D_%7BL_T%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E1%7D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D(q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%5C%5Cparallel%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t))%7D_%7BL_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%7C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1)%7D_%7B-L_0%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-7">(7)</span></p><p data-lake-id="udd9f0248" id="udd9f0248" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="8"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22w1mKN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20I)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-8">(8)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u77b51f1d" id="u77b51f1d" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="9"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22M5A6U%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-9">(9)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5615ad7e" id="u5615ad7e"><span data-lake-id="u0bad8f94" id="u0bad8f94">6️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u910e597a" id="u910e597a"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbe4c2e7" id="ufbe4c2e7">前向后验</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vVrP2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ef877d0" id="u9ef877d0">的闭式表达式推导</span></strong></p><ul list="u9687a9bc"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="uca1109b7" id="uca1109b7"><span data-lake-id="u32d54d77" id="u32d54d77">由前向过程的闭式形式可知</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0416afef" id="u0416afef" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="10"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QEJRJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20I).%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u83701ac3" id="u83701ac3"> </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nzp2N%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)I).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-10">(10)</span></p><ul list="u9687a9bc"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="ud0225b47" id="ud0225b47"><span data-lake-id="uc682cb19" id="uc682cb19">由 Bayes 公式写出后验</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6c9c6688" id="u6c9c6688" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="11"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DhkTf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20x_0)%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D%7Bq(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-11">(11)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u88a660d2" id="u88a660d2" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="12"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eeLBT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20q(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_%7Bt-1%7D)%20q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-12">(12)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u407d4788" id="u407d4788" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="13"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PkJmG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft(%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20x_0%20%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-13">(13)</span></p><ul list="u9687a9bc"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="u6a69527d" id="u6a69527d"><span data-lake-id="u68769910" id="u68769910">忽略与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UoW3G%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua913a206" id="ua913a206">无关的常数项</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u08713b14" id="u08713b14" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="14"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SchtT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5C%7Cx_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20-%202%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20x_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20x_0%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-14">(14)</span></p><ul list="u9687a9bc"><li fid="u720b4b29" data-lake-id="u19afafea" id="u19afafea"><span data-lake-id="u0d296361" id="u0d296361">高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22B1w43%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x%3B%5C%5Cmu%2C%5C%5CSigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f2a6a51" id="u0f2a6a51">的指数项标准形式是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Fh6p6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cfrac12%5C%5Cleft%5Bx%5E%5C%5Ctop%20%5C%5CSigma%5E%7B-1%7Dx-2(%5C%5CSigma%5E%7B-1%7D%5C%5Cmu)%5E%5C%5Ctop%20x%5C%5Cright%5D%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc19dd9a7" id="uc19dd9a7" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="15"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22N8BJv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B-1%7D%20I%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5CSigma_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20I%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-15">(15)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u30930b29" id="u30930b29" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="16"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zs74Q%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%20x_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20x_0%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-16">(16)</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="vNGNf" id="vNGNf"><span data-lake-id="uaa0ff5f8" id="uaa0ff5f8">🦣</span><span data-lake-id="uae06d8ba" id="uae06d8ba"> Diffusion Models And Denoising Autoencoders</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u1c082014" id="u1c082014"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9ef4a602" id="u9ef4a602">将扩散模型的训练目标写为负对数似然的变分上界，并进一步分解为若干时间步上的 KL 散度项</span></strong></p><ul list="uf31fc824"><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="ub023576f" id="ub023576f"><span data-lake-id="u2991f1d3" id="u2991f1d3">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Bllac%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2663ae68" id="u2663ae68">的中间各步，由于前向后验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QpFFF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c5e0691" id="u4c5e0691">具有闭式高斯形式，相应的 KL 项都可以转化为反向过程均值之间的加权平方误差</span></li><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="ub406619f" id="ub406619f"><span data-lake-id="u6a5eaa84" id="u6a5eaa84">结合前向过程的重参数化表示，模型训练又可等价改写为：在给定带噪样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mYZJB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1b3eca5" id="ua1b3eca5">和时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Xlxpt%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42d9c606" id="u42d9c606">的条件下，直接预测其中所包含的噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Pq2G6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="uc430c33b" id="uc430c33b"><span data-lake-id="u913a3d4b" id="u913a3d4b">对最后一步的离散像素解码</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TtK2j%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c189e82" id="u2c189e82">进行专门处理，以保证模型能够对离散图像数据给出合理的概率建模</span></li><li fid="u2c1a5ef4" data-lake-id="uc7a06813" id="uc7a06813"><span data-lake-id="u5adfdd15" id="u5adfdd15">从完整的变分目标出发，进一步提出实践中更常用的简化训练目标，即随机采样时间步并最小化真实噪声与预测噪声之间的均方误差，从而得到更稳定且样本质量更优的训练方式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc37de8db" id="uc37de8db" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="17"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kI8p6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7B%20L%20%5C%5C%3B%3D%5C%5C%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_q%5C%5CBig%5B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7BKL%7D(q(x_T%7Cx_0)%5C%5C%7Cp(x_T))%7D_%7BL_T%7D%20%5C%5C%3B%2B%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3E1%7D%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BD_%7BKL%7D(q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t%2Cx_0)%5C%5C%7Cp_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t))%7D_%7BL_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5C%3B-%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%7Cx_1)%7D_%7B-L_0%7D%20%5C%5CBig%5D%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-17">(17)</span></p><p data-lake-id="uee71a346" id="uee71a346"><strong><span data-lake-id="uea5a2758" id="uea5a2758" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">1️⃣</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ad287b6" id="u6ad287b6" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)"> </span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e67087f" id="u6e67087f">在实现里把前向噪声日程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nANdU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4ae9702e" id="u4ae9702e">预先设定为随时间步变化的序列，不参与训练，因此</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22M8Tuu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_T%20%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u054a774f" id="u054a774f">在训练时是常数项，直接忽略</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u63e8b635" id="u63e8b635"><span data-lake-id="ue1651c1d" id="ue1651c1d">2️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="ub63e687b" id="ub63e687b"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u81a32304" id="u81a32304">把</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nFpfl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%20%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ude4a946e" id="ude4a946e">的 KL 变成均值回归</span></strong></p><ul list="ue50a0eb0"><li fid="ub665c191" data-lake-id="u817dca95" id="u817dca95"><span data-lake-id="u666f8cb6" id="u666f8cb6">先固定反向方差，只学均值，并把协方差固定成各向同性常数， 把训练重点集中到如何预测均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gxGXg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9ef7e11" id="ue9ef7e11">上。首先，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pRQjg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5847aad" id="ua5847aad"> 设为不参与训练的、随时间变化的常数。设定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fETEJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bor%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u401830e8" id="u401830e8">都得到相似的结果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u850c1e6e" id="u850c1e6e" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="18"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FhKSF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%7Cx_t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cmu_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_t%2C%20t)%2C%20%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_t%2C%20t))%2C%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-18">(18)</span></p><ul list="u0151b679"><li fid="ubb4f0970" data-lake-id="ud4ac86cb" id="ud4ac86cb"><span data-lake-id="u1f4a5e13" id="u1f4a5e13">把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22floqh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u91593917" id="u91593917">写成均值回归，让网络输出的均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eRz8E%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f2976df" id="u7f2976df">去拟合真实后验均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22O8EDA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%5C%5Cmu_t%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0c9fa277" id="u0c9fa277" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="19"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Y6Lak%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboxed%7Bq(x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5Cleft(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20x_t%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%20%5C%5Cbeta_t%20I%5C%5Cright).%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-19">(19)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u40551206" id="u40551206" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="20"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wXkkd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_q%5C%5CBig%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Ctilde%5C%5Cmu_t(x_t%2Cx_0)-%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5C%5CBig%5D%2BC%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-20">(20)</span></p><ul list="u032b000f"><li fid="ua2f29c60" data-lake-id="uf18c3b47" id="uf18c3b47"><span data-lake-id="ua4c2285d" id="ua4c2285d">把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qC9Mw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua43d981e" id="ua43d981e">用噪声重参数化写出来，把预测后验均值转成预测噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Q5Hqj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud180a9a3" id="ud180a9a3">的问题</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub0c156d5" id="ub0c156d5" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="21"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nijtF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t(x_0%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2Cx_0%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2CI)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-21">(21)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u633952b2" id="u633952b2" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="22"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HH7NM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_t(x_t%2C%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-22">(22)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u646672d4" id="u646672d4" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="23"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gd2zM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-23">(23)</span></p><ul list="uc3b82c5d"><li fid="udcd77bea" data-lake-id="udaf7fd95" id="udaf7fd95"><span data-lake-id="uebab1978" id="uebab1978" style="color: #000000">把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OkXn3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a38cc6c" id="u7a38cc6c" style="color: #000000">写成只依赖</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SS8fL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20(x_0%2C%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%20%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u811ff547" id="u811ff547" style="color: #000000">的形式， </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JBXOB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud8b91cac" id="ud8b91cac" style="color: #000000">必须在给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fojPI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub51a680b" id="ub51a680b" style="color: #000000">的情况下预测一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MNrEG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6fa6b70a" id="u6fa6b70a" style="color: #000000">的量。不直接学</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22p0Bt9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93383a43" id="u93383a43" style="color: #000000">，而是让网络学</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YBuuK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uaa8d2173" id="uaa8d2173" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="24"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22By0Y1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnL_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20C%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D%7D_t%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-24">(24)</span></p><ul list="ue8a3ecbc"><li fid="uc082f73b" data-lake-id="ua8bb0583" id="ua8bb0583"><strong><span data-lake-id="u72020415" id="u72020415" style="color: #004347">训练目标直接变成多噪声尺度的去噪自编码器 / score matching。 优化一个类似去噪 score matching 的目标，与通过变分推断去拟合一个具有 Langevin dynamics 形式的有限时间采样链边缘分布，本质上是等价的</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufdaf769a" id="ufdaf769a" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="25"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ViEBs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D%7D_t%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2Ct))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-25">(25)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue9437100" id="ue9437100" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="26"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bTvBs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5E2%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%5C%5Calpha_t%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%2C%20t%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-26">(26)</span></p><ul list="u2905c40f"><li fid="uec94c341" data-lake-id="ue3e3289f" id="ue3e3289f"><span data-lake-id="uf36f5550" id="uf36f5550">模型将反向过程建模为高斯转移</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22p9NIb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(x_%7Bt-1%7D%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%2C%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%5C%5Cbigr)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubfdcdcef" id="ubfdcdcef">，因此一旦网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nZz17%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2404c9a2" id="u2404c9a2">能够从当前带噪样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oL7bL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u556c5e70" id="u556c5e70">中预测出噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YCWQw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u120feb8d" id="u120feb8d">，就可以先由噪声预测写出反向均值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VN6OR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%5C%5Cright)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81a3a79d" id="u81a3a79d">。从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Uv8KJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubccfc00f" id="ubccfc00f">采样就等价于</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub8cd8eaa" id="ub8cd8eaa" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="27"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XY8HA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmu%2C%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20I)%20%5C%5Ciff%20x%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmu%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma%20z%2C%20z%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20I).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-27">(27)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u310b13e7" id="u310b13e7" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="28"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22d5E0E%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20x_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbeta_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma_t%20z%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20z%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20I).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-28">(28)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8bc69f30" id="u8bc69f30"><span data-lake-id="u5d613cc2" id="u5d613cc2">3️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="u04c166c4" id="u04c166c4"> 最后一步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NqgdA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_0%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue747a19c" id="ue747a19c">对离散图像进行建模：假设图像数据由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jrxo3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B0%2C1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C255%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1474b290" id="u1474b290">中的整数像素组成，并将其线性缩放到区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BDPNQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B-1%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda518fff" id="uda518fff">。这样做可以保证反向过程中的神经网络从标准高斯先验</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uyBc9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(x_T)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5ef7321" id="ud5ef7321">出发时，始终处理尺度一致的输入。为获得离散形式的对数似然，将反向过程的最后一项设为一个由高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wTrfr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(x%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_1%2C1)%2C%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%20I%5C%5Cbigr)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ac55fb7" id="u3ac55fb7">导出的独立离散解码器，即</span></p><ul list="u90a88c39"><li fid="u322229e4" data-lake-id="u4c79f97f" id="u4c79f97f"><span data-lake-id="u685bb8a8" id="u685bb8a8">前面</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Q8DUk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue1db907e" id="ue1db907e">的各步都在连续空间里做高斯转移。但真实数据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gmcsJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub413aa51" id="ub413aa51">本质是离散像素格点，直接用连续高斯密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rsqL3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x_0%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2I)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1dbbeba5" id="u1dbbeba5">去当作离散概率，会出现离散似然不对齐的问题</span></li><li fid="u322229e4" data-lake-id="uc4258139" id="uc4258139"><span data-lake-id="u6a0f51cc" id="u6a0f51cc">把最后一步定义成</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud65d8f7d" id="ud65d8f7d">离散化高斯解码器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8d1f5dd2" id="u8d1f5dd2">：对每个维度（每个像素通道）把连续高斯在对应 bin 上的概率质量积分出来，并且假设各维独立</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub3fc0ed0" id="ub3fc0ed0" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="29"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YXWuo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5ED%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Cdelta_-(x_0%5Ei)%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cdelta_%2B(x_0%5Ei)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbig(x%3B%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta%5Ei(x_1%2C1)%2C%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%5C%5Cbig)%5C%5C%2Cdx%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-29">(29)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u03ab1c46" id="u03ab1c46" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="30"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HIAlH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cdelta_%2B(x)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cinfty%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%7D%5C%5Cquad%20x%3D1%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cnx%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B255%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%7D%5C%5Cquad%20x%3C1%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cdelta_-(x)%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn-%5C%5Cinfty%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%7D%5C%5Cquad%20x%3D-1%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cnx-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B255%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%7D%5C%5Cquad%20x%3E-1%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-30">(30)</span></p><ul list="u93db202d"><li fid="u9585d1dc" data-lake-id="ufe15c5f5" id="ufe15c5f5"><span data-lake-id="u886e2103" id="u886e2103">保证变分下界对应于</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u398d4910" id="u398d4910">离散数据的无损编码长度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7cb43e1d" id="u7cb43e1d">，而无需额外向数据中加入噪声，也不需要在对数似然中显式引入缩放操作的 Jacobian 项。在采样结束时，直接无噪声地输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yEVfF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cmu_%5C%5Ctheta(x_1%2C1)%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u18b14abc" id="u18b14abc"><span data-lake-id="u1f4f049e" id="u1f4f049e">4️⃣</span><span data-lake-id="uc3e6ba35" id="uc3e6ba35"> 从</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf99b781f" id="uf99b781f">样本质量</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufefd1bd0" id="ufefd1bd0">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23e05c61" id="u23e05c61">实现简洁性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0c19bfad" id="u0c19bfad">来看，采用更简单的训练目标更为有效，相应的简化目标为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u38ee4765" id="u38ee4765" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="yfKpI" data-equation-number="31"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JGdAd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%2C%20t%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uc082fcde" id="uc082fcde"> </span><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-yfKpI-31">(31)</span></p><ul list="uf188a39a"><li fid="ub8963984" data-lake-id="ua0633b08" id="ua0633b08"><span data-lake-id="u77a66f29" id="u77a66f29">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QbDX2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a6d5029" id="u4a6d5029">在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22B0xu4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%2C%5C%5Cdots%2CT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u838dbd2f" id="u838dbd2f">间均匀采样。这个目标本质上就是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u285505cb" id="u285505cb">随机选一个时间步，把原图加噪得到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mrTlg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub413af02" id="ub413af02">，再让网络直接预测所加入的噪声</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UHrse%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="ub8963984" data-lake-id="u02b2a32e" id="u02b2a32e"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kZ6eM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsimple%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94dcc6d8" id="u94dcc6d8">可以理解为对原始变分目标的一种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e352c9f" id="u0e352c9f">重加权形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua4f666d4" id="ua4f666d4">。这种简化实际减弱小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Y7OLE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d4d82a6" id="u9d4d82a6">时刻损失项的权重。由于小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gmuiR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubfd6a3e2" id="ubfd6a3e2">对应的是仅含极少噪声的去噪任务，相对较容易；降低其权重后，模型就能把更多能力放在大</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XrAZ8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73847899" id="u73847899">时更困难的强噪声去噪任务上，从而得到更好的样本生成质量</span></li></ul><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><div class="lake-walkthrough">
<figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="ddpm-algorithm-1">
<figcaption id="ddpm-algorithm-1"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong> Training</figcaption>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{r l}
1:&amp;\textbf{repeat}\\[-0.2em]
2:&amp;\quad\mathbf{x}_0\sim q(\mathbf{x}_0)\\[-0.2em]
3:&amp;\quad t\sim\operatorname{Uniform}(\{1,\ldots,T\})\\[-0.2em]
4:&amp;\quad\boldsymbol{\epsilon}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})\\[-0.2em]
5:&amp;\quad\text{Take gradient descent step on}\\[-0.2em]
&amp;\qquad\displaystyle\nabla_\theta\left\|\boldsymbol{\epsilon}-\boldsymbol{\epsilon}_\theta\!\left(\sqrt{\bar{\alpha}_t}\,\mathbf{x}_0+\sqrt{1-\bar{\alpha}_t}\,\boldsymbol{\epsilon},t\right)\right\|^2\\[-0.2em]
6:&amp;\textbf{until }\text{converged}
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-402%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%20l%7D%5Cn1%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Brepeat%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn2%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn3%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Csim%5C%5Coperatorname%7BUniform%7D(%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CT%5C%5C%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn4%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn5%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BTake%20gradient%20descent%20step%20on%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D-%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%2Ct%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C%5E2%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn6%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Buntil%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7Bconverged%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure>
<figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="ddpm-algorithm-2">
<figcaption id="ddpm-algorithm-2"><strong>Algorithm 2</strong> Sampling</figcaption>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{r l}
1:&amp;\mathbf{x}_T\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})\\[-0.2em]
2:&amp;\textbf{for }t=T,\ldots,1\textbf{ do}\\[-0.2em]
3:&amp;\quad\mathbf{z}\sim\mathcal{N}(\mathbf{0},\mathbf{I})\text{ if }t&gt;1\text{, else }\mathbf{z}=\mathbf{0}\\[-0.2em]
4:&amp;\quad\displaystyle\mathbf{x}_{t-1}=\frac{1}{\sqrt{\alpha_t}}\left(\mathbf{x}_t-\frac{1-\alpha_t}{\sqrt{1-\bar{\alpha}_t}}\boldsymbol{\epsilon}_\theta(\mathbf{x}_t,t)\right)+\sigma_t\mathbf{z}\\[-0.2em]
5:&amp;\textbf{end for}\\[-0.2em]
6:&amp;\textbf{return }\mathbf{x}_0
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-403%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%20l%7D%5Cn1%3A%26%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_T%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn2%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Dt%3DT%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C1%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20do%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn3%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%5C%5Ctext%7B%20if%20%7Dt%3E1%5C%5Ctext%7B%2C%20else%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn4%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D_t%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cright)%2B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn5%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn6%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure>
</div></section><h1 data-lake-id="FS16t" id="FS16t"><span data-lake-id="u7dd84981" id="u7dd84981">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="uffb53430" id="uffb53430"> 𝐃𝐞𝐧𝐨𝐢𝐬𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐈𝐦𝐩𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐭 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ub34c03c8" id="ub34c03c8"><span data-lake-id="uaabe09d6" id="uaabe09d6">去噪扩散概率模型与噪声条件 score 网络表明，即使不依赖对抗训练，也能够生成与生成对抗网络相当质量的样本。这类方法的基本思想是在不同高斯噪声水平下进行去噪学习，使模型从受扰动样本中恢复数据结构；在采样阶段，则从白噪声出发，经由逐步去噪的马尔可夫链生成目标样本。该生成过程通常可建立在 Langevin dynamics 之上，或被解释为前向扩散过程的逆过程。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4c52f97" id="uf4c52f97" style="color: #DF2A3F">但其采样过程通常依赖多步马尔可夫链的逐步反演，因此生成效率仍然受限。为缓解这一问题，论文提出去噪扩散隐式模型，并围绕以下两个方面展开改进</span></strong></p><ul list="uc9d542d1"><li fid="u5805ea5e" data-lake-id="u8f7bd67e" id="u8f7bd67e"><span data-lake-id="u164ff914" id="u164ff914">以</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a301f2c" id="u7a301f2c">提升采样效率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99a4f0f1" id="u99a4f0f1">为核心目标，提出去噪扩散隐式模型这一更高效的迭代式隐式概率生成框架。该方法在保持原有训练流程不变的前提下，实现对传统扩散采样方式的有效加速，因而兼具方法上的兼容性与实践上的高效性</span></li><li fid="u5805ea5e" data-lake-id="u1b4a82d2" id="u1b4a82d2"><span data-lake-id="u0cf6191d" id="u0cf6191d">从</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u56932573" id="u56932573">生成过程的建模方式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u365f706f" id="u365f706f">入手，对去噪扩散概率模型进行推广。传统方法将生成过程定义为特定马尔可夫扩散过程的逆过程，而论文</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue48286a8" id="ue48286a8" style="color: #5C0036">进一步提出一类非马尔可夫扩散过程，并证明其仍可导出与原方法一致的训练目标。进一步地，这类非马尔可夫过程在特定条件下可退化为确定性生成过程，从而使模型能够以更少的采样步数生成高质量样本</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc52cfc2f" id="uc52cfc2f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A857.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A118.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1174%2C%22originHeight%22%3A162%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22AiBY1%22%7D" data-asset="assets/da63dda3aac85f72435ba470d12d561e.png"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b9a7031" id="u5b9a7031"> </span></p><p data-lake-id="u16f6fc77" id="u16f6fc77"><strong><span data-lake-id="u79386ba5" id="u79386ba5">去噪扩散隐式模型可被视为一类隐式概率生成模型，并与去噪扩散概率模型保持紧密联系，其关键在于二者共享相同的训练目标</span></strong></p><ul list="u1da6bfa8"><li fid="u15a0c588" data-lake-id="u18d80f1d" id="u18d80f1d"><span data-lake-id="u8207ca83" id="u8207ca83">将原本马尔可夫形式的前向扩散过程推广为一类非马尔可夫扩散过程，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4654f852" id="u4654f852" style="color: #664900">并证明由此得到的变分训练目标具有共同的代理目标，而该代理目标恰与去噪扩散概率模型的训练目标一致</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u908d8b87" id="u908d8b87">。因此，无需重新训练网络，仅通过选择不同的非马尔可夫扩散过程及其对应的逆向生成链，便可在统一训练框架下构造出一族不同的生成模型</span></li><li fid="u15a0c588" data-lake-id="u20b0336b" id="u20b0336b"><span data-lake-id="uc4939226" id="uc4939226">进一步地，部分非马尔可夫扩散过程能够导出更短的生成链，从而以更少的采样步数完成生成，并在仅带来较小质量损失的情况下显著提升采样效率。特别是在特定条件下，这类过程还可对应于确定性的生成机制，从而赋予去噪扩散隐式模型隐式生成模型的性质</span></li><li fid="u15a0c588" data-lake-id="u8da6366c" id="u8da6366c"><span data-lake-id="u7fe19c68" id="u7fe19c68">相较于去噪扩散概率模型，去噪扩散隐式模型在加速采样时仍能保持较高的样本质量，并在快速采样场景下表现出更优性能。此外，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ba9d604" id="u5ba9d604" style="color: #664900">该模型还具有一致性特征</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2d7065cc" id="u2d7065cc">，即从相同初始潜变量出发、采用不同长度生成链得到的样本，在高层语义上仍具有较强相似性，因此更适合实现具有语义意义的潜空间插值</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="jrM6E" id="jrM6E"><span data-lake-id="uf3eb5738" id="uf3eb5738">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="ued8d6159" id="ued8d6159"> Background</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u5b4f8ade" id="u5b4f8ade"><span data-lake-id="u30d1121a" id="u30d1121a"></span><span data-lake-id="ub6478313" id="ub6478313">去噪扩散概率模型是一类潜变量模型，核心思想是在观测变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gtp3s%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue40a85c9" id="ue40a85c9">之外引入一系列与其处于相同样本空间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NlhIk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u06e80c20" id="u06e80c20">中的潜变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eL31Q%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3be5914b" id="u3be5914b">，通过对联合分布的建模来刻画数据生成过程</span></p><p data-lake-id="u91fa7c63" id="u91fa7c63" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="1"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kum1s%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20%3A%3D%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-1">(1)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u1fc4bede" id="u1fc4bede"><span data-lake-id="u89ebd8f8" id="u89ebd8f8"></span><span data-lake-id="u1f0b4d63" id="u1f0b4d63">模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iqShs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e63eaa6" id="u4e63eaa6">通过最大化数据对数似然的变分下界进行学习，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xJLTM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmax_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_1%2C%20%5C%5Cdots%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%7D%20%5B%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%20%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc22a3ae7" id="uc22a3ae7">。其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UXcd4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u268cad9b" id="u268cad9b">表示潜变量的推断分布。不同于变分自编码器等典型潜变量模型，去噪扩散概率模型中的推断过程通常是预先设定且固定的，而非可学习的；同时，其潜变量通常具有较高维度</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua9dbfde4" id="ua9dbfde4"><span data-lake-id="u1518efe1" id="u1518efe1"></span><span data-lake-id="ue469976b" id="ue469976b">Ho 等人将潜变量的推断过程建模为一类由递减序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22J04Kg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%5ET%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b8c9992" id="u4b8c9992">参数化的高斯马尔可夫链</span></p><p data-lake-id="u82043436" id="u82043436" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="2"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22meJon%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20where%20%7D%20q(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cleft(%201%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-2">(2)</span></p><ul list="u4eba1a25"><li fid="u03898cb5" data-lake-id="ueb9c2c6f" id="ueb9c2c6f"><span data-lake-id="u3213dcae" id="u3213dcae">由于该过程以自回归方式将样本从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lPFUC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb37e36a" id="udb37e36a">逐步演化至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fWnep%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84db225b" id="u84db225b">，因此被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4b030610" id="u4b030610">前向过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2007d678" id="u2007d678">。直观而言，前向过程不断向观测样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Y0nx9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubb0bcd76" id="ubb0bcd76">中注入噪声，使其逐步退化为近似纯噪声的状态</span></li><li fid="u03898cb5" data-lake-id="ub9e5ae72" id="ub9e5ae72"><span data-lake-id="ub35e97e6" id="ub35e97e6">与之对应，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3f37530" id="ua3f37530">潜变量模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JWzhx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1df3d8b8" id="u1df3d8b8">则描述一个从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oQZpE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ua7b0f91c" id="ua7b0f91c">逐步生成至</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22D9bfJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uac4ffd91" id="uac4ffd91">的马尔可夫链，其目标在于逼近难以直接求解的逆条件分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22u2tDF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufba2c019" id="ufba2c019">，因此被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua44f4304" id="ua44f4304">生成过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4d644838" id="u4d644838">。从直观上看，生成过程正是对受噪样本逐步执行去噪，以恢复原始数据结构</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9946b8e9" id="u9946b8e9"><span data-lake-id="ue08f6add" id="ue08f6add"></span><span data-lake-id="ua936b3f2" id="ua936b3f2">前向扩散过程的一项关键性质是，给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bZKAG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2579a757" id="u2579a757">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QMexm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6df9171a" id="u6df9171a">的条件分布具有闭式高斯形式，因此可表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sM6S2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udc32d71f" id="udc32d71f">与标准高斯噪声的线性组合。该性质揭示前向过程逐步加噪的本质，也简化训练与采样推导。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TCq6U%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua73b8494" id="ua73b8494">足够接近于零时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rg1VG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_T%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6471c6cb" id="u6471c6cb">收敛到标准高斯分布，故通常设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rWFOO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_T)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u97d70523" id="u97d70523" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="3"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YFqMt%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%20%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_t%3B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t)I)%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-3">(3)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue0708223" id="ue0708223" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="4"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bD6wa%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%20I).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-4">(4)</span></p><ul list="u4a06319c-list"><li id="u4a06319c"><span data-lake-id="uf6ee2f8a" id="uf6ee2f8a"></span><span data-lake-id="uc4ef41a9" id="uc4ef41a9">当各步条件分布均被建模为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f39a539" id="u9f39a539">具有可学习均值、固定方差的高斯分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufa625409" id="ufa625409">时，变分目标可以进一步化简为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1aaddb99" id="u1aaddb99" style="color: #664900">加权去噪回归目标</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u94c68683" id="u94c68683"></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7c371e1f" id="u7c371e1f" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="5"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZCHOZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Cgamma_t%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%2C%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20x_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-5">(5)</span></p><ul list="u346638de"><li fid="u222e418d" data-lake-id="uadd55737" id="uadd55737"><span data-lake-id="u871fd3b5" id="u871fd3b5">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tEkMs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%3D%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d8f1bd3" id="u8d8f1bd3">表示一组按时间步索引的可训练函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ReFNM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D%3A%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%20%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BX%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda6710a2" id="uda6710a2">用于预测从原始样本构造时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RQE5W%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e5d0b11" id="u0e5d0b11">的受扰动样本所用的累计噪声，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oCiS1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%3D%5B%5C%5Cgamma_1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Cgamma_T%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9b34abcc" id="u9b34abcc">为由噪声调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zD7i6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_%7B1%3AT%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0e0f678" id="ub0e0f678">决定的正权重系数。由此，模型训练可等价地理解为：在不同噪声水平下，让网络学习从受扰动样本中恢复对应的高斯噪声</span><span data-lake-id="u855bf887" id="u855bf887"></span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="g2iUp" id="g2iUp"><span data-lake-id="u9096d587" id="u9096d587">🌱</span><span data-lake-id="u0063799a" id="u0063799a"> Variational Inference For Non-Markovian Forward Processes</span></h2><p fid="u0d00f656" data-lake-id="u3a106068" id="u3a106068"><span data-lake-id="u1e451310" id="u1e451310">生成过程近似推断过程的逆过程，因此，减少采样迭代次数需要重新考虑推断过程的构造。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u58b378d0" id="u58b378d0" style="color: #70000D">DDPM 的代理目标</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AwDz4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_%5C%5Cgamma%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6d930a65" id="u6d930a65" style="color: #70000D">仅依赖边缘分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22avI27%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3ad54a34" id="u3ad54a34" style="color: #70000D">，而不直接依赖联合分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eXRKh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D" style="color: #70000D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u386ccd03" id="u386ccd03" style="color: #70000D">。具有相同边缘分布的联合推断分布并不唯一，因此可以将马尔可夫推断过程推广为非马尔可夫形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u96bfc4e2" id="u96bfc4e2">，并沿用同一代理训练目标</span><span data-lake-id="ud3f75f07" id="ud3f75f07"></span>。<span data-lake-id="u01939153" id="u01939153"></span><span data-lake-id="u85f876c9" id="u85f876c9">考虑由实向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NfahK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%5C%5Cge%200%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1e5623e" id="ub1e5623e">索引的一族推断分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EP43g%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BQ%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64ebe2d0" id="u64ebe2d0">，定义为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2a36e64d" id="u2a36e64d"></span></strong><span data-lake-id="u56d42a48" id="u56d42a48"></span></p><p data-lake-id="uae2f1918" id="uae2f1918" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FVN9c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5Cn%3A%3Dq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5Cn%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7Dq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B5pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%5C%5Cquad%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_T%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_T)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B5pt%5D%5Cn%26q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2B%5Cn%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%3E1%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-6">(6)</span></p><ul list="u8fbddd00-list"><li id="u8fbddd00"><span data-lake-id="uee1f578a" id="uee1f578a">均值函数的选择保证，对任意时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MKIz3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a7adf97" id="u8a7adf97">，都有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u8a7adf97-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%5C%5Cright)%22%7D"></card>，从而使联合推断分布具有所需的边缘分布</span>。<span data-lake-id="u1fafc3b9" id="u1fafc3b9"><span data-lake-id="uf129d140" id="uf129d140">根据 Bayes 公式，前向过程为</span></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5c387a42" id="u5c387a42" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="7"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aEa0h%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5C%2Cq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%7Bq_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-7">(7)</span></p><ul><li id="ddim-forward-conditioning"><span data-lake-id="u99ac2d1d" id="u99ac2d1d">该条件分布也是高斯分布。与 DDPM 的扩散过程不同，每个时刻的状态可以同时依赖</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gNwZ2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9af04cb" id="ub9af04cb">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JgbZg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5714448e" id="u5714448e">，因而前向过程不再具有马尔可夫性。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VruwW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b044016" id="u5b044016">的大小控制前向过程的随机程度；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u76cfd898" id="u76cfd898" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VCQ2r%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cto%200%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u659b0111" id="u659b0111" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">时，只要给定 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u659b0111-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card> 和某一时刻的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u659b0111-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card>，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u659b0111-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card> 就随之确定</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u584477c8" id="u584477c8"><span data-lake-id="ud35229ba" id="ud35229ba"></span><span data-lake-id="uc9e6efe0" id="uc9e6efe0">接下来构造可训练的生成过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IbXiq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u816c8cb1" id="u816c8cb1">，使每一步转移分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22C7Y8g%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u491e40e8" id="u491e40e8">利用已知的逆条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IUyp4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%22%7D"></card>。<span data-lake-id="u45bac9bd" id="u45bac9bd"><span data-lake-id="u7937130a" id="u7937130a"></span><span data-lake-id="ub4424b5f" id="ub4424b5f">给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22klqNw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q(x_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d680161" id="u7d680161">和高斯噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22adLMh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CI)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a828e6b" id="u9a828e6b">，时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZwU95%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u368ceff4" id="u368ceff4">的噪声样本可表示为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TcQ3h%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2Cx_0%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon.%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93bc298d" id="u93bc298d">模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uvDtU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d41fb0f" id="u6d41fb0f">在未知</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22g7Ohf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8508dad0" id="u8508dad0">的情况下，仅根据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ccjrg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60db1181" id="u60db1181">预测噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YhOff%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee4f78ee" id="uee4f78ee">。重排上述关系，即得原始样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QjE3J%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cf72514" id="u0cf72514">的去噪估计</span></span></p><p data-lake-id="u8635655b" id="u8635655b" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="8"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OZlRE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-8">(8)</span></p><p data-lake-id="uabf5f0c2" id="uabf5f0c2"><span data-lake-id="uf43c21bb" id="uf43c21bb"></span><span data-lake-id="u6bcb8a87" id="u6bcb8a87">将逆条件分布中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eaYo6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u61a73f39" id="u61a73f39">替换为上述估计，即可构造反向生成过程。从标准高斯先验采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bi7BV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7836a639" id="u7836a639">后，每一步将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gueKe%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufd01afed" id="ufd01afed">代入逆条件分布，得到从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YoUw5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2d1c1a6e" id="u2d1c1a6e">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bNOWh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57e86843" id="u57e86843">的转移核。在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22up9ay%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1d72cfca" id="u1d72cfca">时加入协方差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ESeie%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%20I%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3109bd3f" id="u3109bd3f">的非退化高斯噪声，以保证生成分布具有全空间支撑。逐步转移分布为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4f95d3ef" id="u4f95d3ef" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="9"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22H7ycN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(1)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_1)%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%7D%5C%5Cquad%20t%20%3D%201%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t))%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%2C%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-9">(9)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1093eb6a" id="u1093eb6a" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u9f978628" id="u9f978628">模型参数通过最小化以下变分目标进行学习</span></p><p data-lake-id="udf938f6f" id="udf938f6f" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="10"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22E35V3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnJ_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta)%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%20%5B%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B1%3AT%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20-%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20-%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-10">(10)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua1895c15" id="ua1895c15"><em><strong><span data-lake-id="ua306f502" id="ua306f502" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">Theorem 1. 对任意</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LNjra%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%3E0%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><em><strong><span data-lake-id="ubbcf7605" id="ubbcf7605" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">，都存在权重向量</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GXUOp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f1b58d8" id="u4f1b58d8" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">及与模型参数无关的常数</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22teLIj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22C%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u4fafe991" id="u4fafe991" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">，使得</span></strong></em><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Bbqjh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%3DL_%5C%5Cgamma%2BC%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card></p><ul list="u90588383"><li fid="ucf77612a" data-lake-id="u39c250f2" id="u39c250f2"><span data-lake-id="udded1611" id="udded1611"></span><span data-lake-id="u0975f893" id="u0975f893">若模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mKEWT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9524c6e5" id="u9524c6e5">在不同时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jjnlq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32bdc6d9" id="u32bdc6d9">上</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1ddbb679" id="u1ddbb679">不共享参数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u07d168e2" id="u07d168e2">，则</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lcb5M%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udf862164" id="udf862164">的最优解不依赖于正权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gk6aG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u256d4478" id="u256d4478">，因为各时间步的损失可以独立优化，而正权重不会改变各项的最优解</span><span fid="ucf77612a" data-lake-id="ude8e9450" id="ude8e9450"><span data-lake-id="u8af014cd" id="u8af014cd">。这一性质既支持 DDPM 使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IFDVl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_1%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f452df3" id="u4f452df3">作为代理目标，也表明它可用于优化</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jOdSo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22J_%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card></span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="ec8Zn" id="ec8Zn"><span data-lake-id="u8b91433e" id="u8b91433e">🦋</span><span data-lake-id="u534bd401" id="u534bd401"> Sampling From Generalized Generative Processes</span></h2><section class="lake-revised-section" id="ddim-sampling"><p>以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-350%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%7D"></card> 为目标训练的模型，不仅适用于 DDPM 的马尔可夫推断过程，也适用于由 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-351%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card> 参数化的非马尔可夫前向过程。因此，可以直接使用预训练的 DDPM 模型，通过改变 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-352%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card> 选择符合采样需求的生成过程</p>
<p><strong>Denoising Diffusion Implicit Models：</strong> 由前文定义的生成分布 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-353%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%22%7D"></card>，对 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-354%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%7D"></card>，可从 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-355%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card> 生成 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-356%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card></p>
<div class="equation lake-numbered-block" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="x_{t-1} = \sqrt{\alpha_{t-1}}\underbrace{\left(\frac{x_t-\sqrt{1-\alpha_t}\,\epsilon_\theta^{(t)}(x_t)}{\sqrt{\alpha_t}}\right)}_{\text{predicted }x_0} + \underbrace{\sqrt{1-\alpha_{t-1}-\sigma_t^2}\,\epsilon_\theta^{(t)}(x_t)}_{\text{direction pointing to }x_t} + \underbrace{\sigma_t\epsilon_t}_{\text{random noise}}
" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="11"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-357%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpredicted%20%7Dx_0%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdirection%20pointing%20to%20%7Dx_t%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cepsilon_t%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Brandom%20noise%7D%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-11">(11)</span></div>
<ul>
<li>
<p>其中，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-358%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_t%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2CI)%22%7D"></card> 是与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-359%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card> 独立的标准高斯噪声，并约定 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-360%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_0%3A%3D1%22%7D"></card>；<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-361%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%7D"></card> 时使用前文定义的末端分布。不同的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-362%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card> 对应不同的生成过程，但都使用同一个噪声预测模型 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-363%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card>，无需重新训练。当各步取 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-364%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%7D%22%7D"></card> 时，前向过程为马尔可夫过程，生成过程对应 DDPM</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>当所有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-365%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%3D0%22%7D"></card> 时，除 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-366%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D1%22%7D"></card> 外，前向过程在给定 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-367%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt-1%7D%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-368%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card> 后是确定性的；生成过程中的随机噪声项也随之消失</strong>。此时，模型通过固定映射将潜变量 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-369%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%7D"></card> 转换为样本 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-370%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card>，形成隐式概率模型，称为去噪扩散隐式模型（DDIM）。它沿用 DDPM 的训练目标，而对应的前向过程不再是扩散过程</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Accelerated Generation Processes：</strong> 上述前向过程包含 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-371%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card> 步，生成过程也相应需要执行 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-372%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card> 步采样。但只要边缘分布 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-373%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D"></card> 保持不变，去噪目标 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-374%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%7D"></card> 就不依赖具体的前向过程，因此可以构造长度小于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-375%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card> 的前向过程，<strong>无需重新训练即可缩短生成链</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>将前向过程定义在潜变量子集 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-376%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx_%7B%5C%5Ctau_1%7D%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cx_%7B%5C%5Ctau_S%7D%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card> 上，其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-377%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%7D"></card> 是 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-378%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card> 中长度为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-379%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22S%22%7D"></card> 的严格递增子序列。在这些变量上构造顺序前向过程，并保持边缘分布 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-380%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q(x_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7Dx_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D)I)%22%7D"></card>。生成过程按 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-381%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Breversed%7D(%5C%5Ctau)%22%7D"></card> 的顺序采样，该序列称为<strong>采样轨迹</strong>；当其长度远小于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-382%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card> 时，所需的迭代次数显著减少</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: center">
<img class="lake-image" style="width:418.4px;aspect-ratio:418.4/126" src="assets/6e6a54fe8a00ae0dfa2a818cefa0da1b.png" alt="采样轨迹为 τ = [1, 3] 的加速生成图模型" width="418.4" height="126" decoding="async">
</p>
<ul>
<li>与前文相同的论证表明，仍可使用以 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-383%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%7D"></card> 训练的模型，只需将采样更新中的相邻时间步改为所选轨迹中的相邻时间步。这一构造同时适用于 DDPM、DDIM 及上述其他生成过程，使训练步数与实际采样步数可以分别选择</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Relevance To Neural ODEs：</strong> 将 DDIM 的确定性更新式重写为如下形式，可以看出它与求解常微分方程的 Euler 方法之间的关系</p>
<div class="equation lake-numbered-block" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\frac{x_{t-\Delta t}}{\sqrt{\alpha_{t-\Delta t}}}=\frac{x_t}{\sqrt{\alpha_t}}+\left(\sqrt{\frac{1-\alpha_{t-\Delta t}}{\alpha_{t-\Delta t}}}-\sqrt{\frac{1-\alpha_t}{\alpha_t}}\right)\epsilon_\theta^{(t)}(x_t)
" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="12"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-384%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2B%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D%7D-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%5Cn%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-12">(12)</span></div>
<ul>
<li>重新参数化为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-385%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)%2F%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%22%7D"></card> 与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-386%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%20x(t)%3Dx_t%2F%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%22%7D"></card>，其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-387%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%7D"></card> 是满足 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-388%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(0)%3D0%22%7D"></card> 的连续递增函数。这里的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-389%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%7D"></card> 表示重参数化后的连续噪声尺度，与前文控制采样随机性的 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-390%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%7D"></card> 不同。上述更新可视为以下 ODE 的 Euler 离散化</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation lake-numbered-block" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="d\bar x(t)=\epsilon_\theta^{(t)}\!\left(\frac{\bar x(t)}{\sqrt{\sigma(t)^2+1}}\right)d\sigma(t)
" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="13"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-391%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cbar%20x(t)%3D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cbar%20x(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Csigma(t)%5E2%2B1%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)d%5C%5Csigma(t)%5Cn%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-13">(13)</span></div>
<ul>
<li>当离散步数足够多时，也可以沿相反方向从 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-392%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%7D"></card> 积分至 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-393%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card>，将观测样本 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-394%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card> 编码为潜变量 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-395%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%7D"></card>，从而获得与生成过程对应的潜在表示</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>在噪声预测模型达到最优时，上述 ODE 与 Variance-Exploding SDE 对应的 probability flow ODE 等价，但二者采用的离散采样更新不同</strong>。对后者按时间 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-396%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card> 使用 Euler 方法，得到</p>
<div class="equation lake-numbered-block" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\frac{x_{t-\Delta t}}{\sqrt{\alpha_{t-\Delta t}}}=\frac{x_t}{\sqrt{\alpha_t}}+\frac12\left(\frac{1-\alpha_{t-\Delta t}}{\alpha_{t-\Delta t}}-\frac{1-\alpha_t}{\alpha_t}\right)\sqrt{\frac{\alpha_t}{1-\alpha_t}}\,\epsilon_\theta^{(t)}(x_t)
" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="14"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-397%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2B%5C%5Cfrac12%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%7D-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%5Cn%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-14">(14)</span></div>
<ul>
<li>当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-398%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card> 与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-399%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%22%7D"></card> 足够接近时，两种更新近似一致；在较少采样步数下，离散化方式会带来差异</li>
</ul></section><h2 data-lake-id="sMidY" id="sMidY"><span data-lake-id="u4ce18672" id="u4ce18672">☃️</span><span data-lake-id="u73c9872d" id="u73c9872d"> Proofs</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue44ce3c4" id="ue44ce3c4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u57f422cb" id="u57f422cb">Lemma 1. 设前向过程为关于</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wjkTD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fe82831" id="u8fe82831">的非马尔可夫联合分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Itbmy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7B1%3AT%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_T%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5E%7BT%7D%20q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%2C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9107fbf1" id="u9107fbf1">其中</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u46a5d1d4" id="u46a5d1d4" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="15"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pFhej%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20I%20%5C%5Cright).%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-15">(15)</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf117f8fa" id="uf117f8fa"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf0db0112" id="uf0db0112">在该构造下，任意时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BD4SU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2215433b" id="u2215433b">的边缘分布仍满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yj0I6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2C%5C%5C%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)I%5C%5Cbigr).%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf9efe381" id="uf9efe381">因此，DDIM 改变的是前向演化路径的分解方式，而不是各时刻的边缘分布，这也保证其能够与 DDPM 共享相同的训练目标</span></strong></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u8b7b0920" id="u8b7b0920"><span data-lake-id="ue6c7d0f9" id="ue6c7d0f9">证明：对某个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uOKz2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5Cle%20t%5C%5Cle%20T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u644e2d8d" id="u644e2d8d">，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TWYcx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_t%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)I%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7793630" id="ue7793630">若能进一步推出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EAGfF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D)I%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua925bc24" id="ua925bc24"> 则由于基例</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22F2xUx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3DT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5c733bc" id="ub5c733bc">已经成立，因此可对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TJJ4c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48578c41" id="u48578c41">从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22w6rJX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7ef3cd3e" id="u7ef3cd3e">到 1 使用归纳法证明该结论</span></li></ul><ul><li data-lake-id="u9c631934" id="u9c631934"><span data-lake-id="ua91c0571" id="ua91c0571">首先，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22N77nB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7D%20q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6cba2c7b" id="u6cba2c7b"> 并且</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc73b4192" id="uc73b4192" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="16"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22esaX1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-16">(16)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua9681694" id="ua9681694" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="17"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Zq1OT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%5C%5Cright).%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc91b897b" id="uc91b897b">​</span><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-17">(17)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="uac2d5159" id="uac2d5159"><span data-lake-id="u831d67d8" id="u831d67d8">由 Bishop (2006) 式 (2.115) 可知，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Axl41%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%5C%5Csigma(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9dbf1d7a" id="u9dbf1d7a">为高斯分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u00c9d700" id="u00c9d700" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="18"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lFdbF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20-%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-18">(18)</span></p><p data-lake-id="uac27d6db" id="uac27d6db" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="19"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JuyZU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCov%7D%5B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%5D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%20%3D%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-19">(19)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u217effc4" id="u217effc4"><span data-lake-id="u89c2f193" id="u89c2f193">因此，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tFfdZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7Dx_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D)I%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc14372ad" id="uc14372ad">从而归纳成立</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud56c7fc5" id="ud56c7fc5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u66201e61" id="u66201e61">Theorem 1. 对于使上述高斯转移有定义的任意</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22R3pit%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf4670a4e" id="uf4670a4e">，都存在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22u5kwV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u64a82a8e" id="u64a82a8e">和常数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yRZVq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22C%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0fa7c255" id="u0fa7c255">，使得</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gmbnR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%3DL_%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D%2BC%22%7D"></card></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u6f07c689" id="u6f07c689"><span data-lake-id="ucbbf080d" id="ucbbf080d">证明：由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fOcZ6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22J_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d7ec71f" id="u5d7ec71f">的定义可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua6ffd888" id="ua6ffd888" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="20"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Xb97e%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnJ_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%26%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bq_%5C%5Csigma(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%5C%5CBiggl%5B%5Cn%20%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(x_T%5C%5Cmid%20x_0)-%5C%5Clog%20p(x_T)%2B%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5ET%5C%5Clog%20q_%5C%5Csigma(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%5Cn%20-%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5ET%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%5C%5CBiggr%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cequiv%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bq_%5C%5Csigma(x_%7B0%3AT%7D)%7D%5C%5CBiggl%5B%5Cn%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D2%7D%5ET%20D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%20q_%5C%5Csigma(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%5Cn%20%5C%5Cright)-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(1)%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%5C%5CBiggr%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-20">(20)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u67c6b158" id="u67c6b158"><span data-lake-id="uf06ef167" id="uf06ef167">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BbA2u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3E1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub16cbc4e" id="ub16cbc4e">，有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc05fca12" id="uc05fca12" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="21"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22K4q1G%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ckappa_t%26%3A%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D%7D-%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5Cn%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt-1%7D-%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20t%3E1%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2Cx_t%7DD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5Cn%20q_%5C%5Csigma(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t%2Cx_0)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%2Cp_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_%7Bt-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x_t)%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ckappa_t%5E2%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%5Cn%20%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2Cx_t%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cx_0-f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ckappa_t%5E2(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5Cn%20%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2C%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cepsilon-%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2C%5Cn%20%5C%5Cquad%20x_t%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7Dx_0%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5Cepsilon.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-21">(21)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="ua0fa25d5" id="ua0fa25d5"><span data-lake-id="u35a627f8" id="u35a627f8">对于末端项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22X7sTp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce7d905d" id="uce7d905d">，有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucddc5d44" id="ucddc5d44" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="22"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hGayb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2Cx_1%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B-%5C%5Clog%20p_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(1)%7D(x_0%5C%5Cmid%20x_1)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cequiv%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%7D%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2Cx_1%7D%5Cn%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7Cx_0-f_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(1)%7D(x_1)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_1%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_1%5E2%5C%5Calpha_1%7D%5Cn%20%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2C%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cepsilon-%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(1)%7D(x_1)%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2C%5Cn%20%5C%5Cquad%20x_1%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_1%7Dx_0%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Calpha_1%7D%5C%5Cepsilon.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-22">(22)</span></p><section class="lake-revised-section" id="ddim-proof-conclusion"><div class="equation lake-numbered-block" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{aligned}
J_\sigma(\epsilon_\theta)
&amp;=\sum_{t=1}^{T}\frac{\kappa_t^2(1-\alpha_t)}{2\sigma_t^2\alpha_t}\,\mathbb E_{x_0,\epsilon_t}\!\left[\left\|\epsilon_\theta^{(t)}(x_t)-\epsilon_t\right\|_2^2\right]+C
=L_\gamma(\epsilon_\theta)+C\\[6pt]
&amp;\text{where}\quad\gamma_t=\frac{\kappa_t^2(1-\alpha_t)}{2\sigma_t^2\alpha_t},\quad\kappa_1:=1,\quad t=1,\ldots,T
\end{aligned}
" data-equation-paper="FS16t" data-equation-number="23"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-400%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5CnJ_%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta)%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7BT%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ckappa_t%5E2(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbb%20E_%7Bx_0%2C%5C%5Cepsilon_t%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(t)%7D(x_t)-%5C%5Cepsilon_t%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%2BC%5Cn%3DL_%5C%5Cgamma(%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta)%2BC%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cgamma_t%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ckappa_t%5E2(1-%5C%5Calpha_t)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%2C%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ckappa_1%3A%3D1%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CT%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-FS16t-23">(23)</span></div></section><h1 data-lake-id="KMj1j" id="KMj1j"><span data-lake-id="u5ca67037" id="u5ca67037">🦜</span><span data-lake-id="uc7d01105" id="uc7d01105"> 𝐒𝐜𝐨𝐫𝐞-𝐁𝐚𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐆𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡 𝐒𝐭𝐨𝐜𝐡𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐢𝐜 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐚𝐥 𝐄𝐪𝐮𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uad84a501" id="uad84a501"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue1693467" id="ue1693467">从数据中构造噪声是容易的，而从噪声中恢复数据则构成生成建模问题</span></strong></p><ul list="u7e9a3d9f"><li fid="ueaa6044f" data-lake-id="u8cb26769" id="u8cb26769"><span data-lake-id="u4ed41ca6" id="u4ed41ca6">论文提出一种随机微分方程（SDE）框架：其前向过程通过逐步注入噪声，将复杂数据分布平滑地转化为已知先验分布；相应地，逆向过程则通过逐步去噪，将先验分布重新映射回数据分布</span></li><li fid="ueaa6044f" data-lake-id="ud19675c2" id="ud19675c2"><span data-lake-id="ua0bf48b9" id="ua0bf48b9">关键在于，该逆时间 SDE 仅依赖于随时间变化的梯度场，即受扰动数据分布的得分函数（score）。借助基于得分生成建模领域的最新进展，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua947228f" id="ua947228f">​</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua4e99bfe" id="ua4e99bfe">利用神经网络对这些得分函数进行精确估计，并结合数值 SDE 求解器实现样本生成</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udd81e86c" id="udd81e86c"><strong><span data-lake-id="udaa436fd" id="udaa436fd">已有两类成功的概率生成模型都遵循“逐步加噪—再逆向恢复”的基本思想，将这两类方法统一归为基于得分的生成模型</span></strong></p><ul list="uce9e8d0e"><li fid="u2e802638" data-lake-id="ucfac92cb" id="ucfac92cb"><span data-lake-id="u25945954" id="u25945954">基于 Langevin 动力学的得分匹配方法（SMLD）在每个噪声尺度上估计得分函数，并在生成阶段通过 Langevin 动力学沿着逐步减小的噪声尺度进行采样</span></li><li fid="u2e802638" data-lake-id="u63aae817" id="u63aae817"><span data-lake-id="u44e2ca10" id="u44e2ca10">去噪扩散概率模型（DDPM）则学习一系列概率模型，以逐步逆转噪声破坏过程。对于连续状态空间而言，DDPM 的训练目标本质上也在各个噪声尺度上隐式估计得分函数</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u44b05163" id="u44b05163"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbdcf464" id="ufbdcf464">在此基础上，进一步提出一个以 SDE 为核心的统一理论框架，用以概括并推广上述方法</span></strong></p><ul list="u26b9f684"><li fid="u0a29ed4f" data-lake-id="u28d454d5" id="u28d454d5"><span data-lake-id="u04e18d21" id="u04e18d21">与基于有限个离散噪声分布的建模方式不同，考虑的是一个随时间连续演化的分布族，其演化由预先设定、与具体数据点无关且不含可训练参数的前向 SDE 描述。通过逆转这一扩散过程，随机噪声可以被逐步塑造为数据样本</span></li><li fid="u0a29ed4f" data-lake-id="u5c6bd79c" id="u5c6bd79c"><span data-lake-id="u5b2b4982" id="u5b2b4982">更重要的是，只要已知各时刻边缘分布的得分函数，就能够由前向 SDE 推导出对应的逆时间 SDE。基于这一性质，通过训练一个时间依赖的神经网络来估计得分函数，并利用数值 SDE 求解器完成采样</span></li><li fid="u0a29ed4f" data-lake-id="ub05cb42f" id="ub05cb42f"><span data-lake-id="ue2cd15d5" id="ue2cd15d5">提出预测器—校正器（predictor-corrector）框架，以修正离散化逆时间 SDE 所带来的数值误差；同时推导出一个与 SDE 采样分布等价的神经常微分方程（ODE），从而支持精确似然计算并进一步提升采样效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0ad5a85e" id="u0ad5a85e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A564.2000122070312%2C%22height%22%3A238.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A899%2C%22originHeight%22%3A380%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2433049a%22%7D" data-asset="assets/002d6fd96e9679e6de57f8411d747a50.png"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id="hzILC" id="hzILC"><span data-lake-id="ub84ed960" id="ub84ed960">🐦‍🔥</span><span data-lake-id="ud0ccccb2" id="ud0ccccb2"> Background</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ud15c85e9" id="ud15c85e9"><strong>SMLD：</strong> <span data-lake-id="uc596647e" id="uc596647e">设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xmWbd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc19cb825" id="uc19cb825">为高斯扰动核，对应的扰动分布为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22e9MeB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D)%3A%3D%5C%5Cint%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cp_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u642056b0" id="u642056b0">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GoU1u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3619bfa1" id="u3619bfa1">表示数据分布。取递增的正噪声尺度序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QOaxR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%3D%5C%5Csigma_1%3C%5C%5Csigma_2%3C%5C%5Ccdots%3C%5C%5Csigma_N%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D.%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uae85cebb" id="uae85cebb">选择足够小的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22omO6h%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E2%81%A1%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u419b61fd" id="u419b61fd">，使</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Q8GnF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube68ab92" id="ube68ab92">选择足够大的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SM2SN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E2%81%A1%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaca36ab1" id="uaca36ab1">，使</span><span data-lake-id="u4b9df525" id="u4b9df525" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Qli62%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%3B%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%7D"></card></span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="ufddaadd3" id="ufddaadd3"><span data-lake-id="u6af7c27c" id="u6af7c27c">训练</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7676f52f" id="u7676f52f">噪声条件得分网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7411855" id="ue7411855"> </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xqD0A%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf09a6e5" id="ubf09a6e5">时，对不同噪声尺度的去噪得分匹配损失加权求和</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u74d9e20c" id="u74d9e20c" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="1"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZpaUi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B*%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%20%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%20-%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-1">(1)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u7afa5e46" id="u7afa5e46"><span data-lake-id="udee371d0" id="udee371d0">在数据充分、模型容量足够大的条件下，最优模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lzGHP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua7b5899c" id="ua7b5899c">几乎处处等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22p0eNv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u14c3084e" id="u14c3084e">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fjFR8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%22%7D"></card>。<span data-lake-id="ud9b00355" id="ud9b00355"><span data-lake-id="u70ecf5db" id="u70ecf5db">采样时，按噪声尺度从大到小，针对每个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vWfOw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f73a32e" id="u9f73a32e">运行 M 步 Langevin MCMC</span></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uff45c8d2" id="uff45c8d2" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="2"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CdHv3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5Em%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5E%7Bm-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cepsilon_i%5C%5C%2C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5E%7Bm-1%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Cepsilon_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%5Em%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20m%3D1%2C2%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2CM%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-2">(2)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="uec06f9b1" id="uec06f9b1"><span data-lake-id="u45f8929d" id="u45f8929d"></span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nBfDt%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_i%3E0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa33a83f" id="ufa33a83f">为步长，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PP2oH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%5Em%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufe73ebd4" id="ufe73ebd4">为标准高斯噪声。按</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vF3cv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%3DN%2CN-1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u650d7961" id="u650d7961">采样，取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ovmnb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%5E0%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u407da675" id="u407da675">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YPW05%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%3CN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue80fee53" id="ue80fee53">时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ppsES%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5E0%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5EM%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u151ed2ee" id="u151ed2ee"><strong>DDPM：</strong>选取正噪声尺度<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22J9S0Y%22%2C%22code%22%3A%220%3C%5C%5Cbeta_1%2C%5C%5Cbeta_2%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C%5C%5Cbeta_N%3C1.%22%7D"></card>对数据样本<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22M6k24%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card>构造离散马尔可夫链<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DuYQ7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card>，其转移核为</p><p id="ddpm-sde-equation-3" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="3"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22g3KOE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%3B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cbeta_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-3">(3)</span></p><p>由此可得</p><p id="ddpm-sde-equation-4" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="4"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t55fA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%3B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%2C(1-%5C%5Calpha_i)%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-4">(4)</span></p><p>其中<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22w75V9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_i%3A%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5E%7Bi%7D(1-%5C%5Cbeta_j).%22%7D"></card>对应的边缘分布为</p><p id="ddpm-sde-equation-5" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="5"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ib4aA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cint%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cp_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-5">(5)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u42b3be2a" id="u42b3be2a"><span data-lake-id="ua4726c0c" id="ua4726c0c">预设噪声尺度，使终态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xUKKT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0cc62caf" id="u0cc62caf">近似服从标准高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TyVW1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4590736" id="uc4590736">，反向转移分布与 ELBO 加权训练目标分别为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue3f311be" id="ue3f311be" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lsSoO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%3B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%7D%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2B%5C%5Cbeta_i%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2Ci)%5C%5Cbigr)%2C%20%5C%5Cbeta_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-6">(6)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua07a89a9" id="ua07a89a9" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="7"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FHNXm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%20(1-%5C%5Calpha_i)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%2Ci)%20-%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-7">(7)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u4cbed6fd" id="u4cbed6fd"><span data-lake-id="ufd949b51" id="ufd949b51">得到最优模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22E5eiB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ci)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u05472731" id="u05472731">后，从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22P4czl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_N%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2ff8df96" id="u2ff8df96">出发，沿逆向马尔可夫链生成样本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua3f94f9a" id="ua3f94f9a" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="8"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sqAaw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2B%5C%5Cbeta_i%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%2Ci)%5C%5Cbigr)%20%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_i%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3DN%2CN-1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2C1%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-8">(8)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u42176bdc" id="u42176bdc"><span data-lake-id="u55a2ad7f" id="u55a2ad7f">该过程称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f1fbb00" id="u0f1fbb00">祖先采样</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u32406c6c" id="u32406c6c">（ancestral sampling），等价于从图模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aMyJJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cprod_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7Dp_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3ed44cf8" id="u3ed44cf8">中采样。训练目标同样是加权去噪得分匹配，因此最优模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qUdDw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%2Ci)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a8c7bff" id="u5a8c7bff">估计扰动数据分布的得分函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UXCGM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d76310f" id="u9d76310f">。两种方法的权重均与相应扰动核的 score 均方范数成反比</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u607098d5" id="u607098d5" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="9"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ScE40%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_i)%20%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-9">(9)</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="uJEu0" id="uJEu0"><span data-lake-id="u922a21e9" id="u922a21e9">🦅</span><span data-lake-id="u6e02d9f5" id="u6e02d9f5"> Score-Based Generative Modeling With SDEs</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u953a8cdb" id="u953a8cdb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u905b45ad" id="u905b45ad" style="color: #70000D">前述方法之所以能够取得良好生成效果，一个关键原因在于它们在多个噪声尺度下对数据进行扰动建模。基于这一观察，论文进一步将这一思想推广到连续情形，即引入无穷多个噪声尺度，使受扰动数据分布在噪声逐渐增强的过程中按照随机微分方程（SDE）连续演化</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u07c70253" id="u07c70253" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A746.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A259.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1062%2C%22originHeight%22%3A369%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u73242c73%22%7D" data-asset="assets/eae8e2c0c1fae508bd04530da2abc2b0.png"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ucc01776a" id="ucc01776a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22957f6c" id="u22957f6c">论文的目标是构造一个由连续时间变量</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22b1Puw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u13197e09" id="u13197e09">索引的扩散过程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PNLZT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x(t)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uf193b71b" id="uf193b71b">，使其在初始时刻满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UxDgW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x(0)%5C%5Csim%20p_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u99d531f0" id="u99d531f0">，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lBWuY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u44445a1a" id="u44445a1a">为数据分布；在终止时刻满足</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XSX9c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x(T)%5C%5Csim%20p_T%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6af2aace" id="u6af2aace">，其中</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WyCVV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d255649" id="u0d255649">为易于采样的先验分布。换言之，该过程旨在将数据分布连续地扩散到一个可处理的先验分布。为此，论文使用 Itô 随机微分方程对该扩散过程进行建模</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua9371ba1" id="ua9371ba1" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="10"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22meYdd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%3Df(x%2Ct)%5C%5C%2Cdt%2Bg(t)%5C%5C%2Cdw%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-10">(10)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="ua54b0c44" id="ua54b0c44"><span data-lake-id="ub89d009e" id="ub89d009e">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Dw19X%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22w%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97b7dc8d" id="u97b7dc8d">为标准 Wiener 过程，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Henhj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cf5ef9f" id="u2cf5ef9f">为漂移项，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qzKhp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22g(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u074a4d1a" id="u074a4d1a">为扩散系数。假设扩散系数为与状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FdKeH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4d7e8b4b" id="u4d7e8b4b">无关的标量函数，但这一设定可以自然推广到更一般的情形。在适当正则条件下，该 SDE 存在唯一强解。进一步地，论文记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YVbcn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8525bf9f" id="u8525bf9f">为时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22D4Qmx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39389cad" id="u39389cad">的状态分布密度，并用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dnxfc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7Bst%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(s))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u96ab10cc" id="u96ab10cc">表示从时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tpHCE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8144c81" id="ub8144c81">到时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Hy9xF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u66d58901" id="u66d58901">的转移核。在具体建模中，终态分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OiRDj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u873bf42b" id="u873bf42b">通常被设定为不包含数据结构信息、但便于高效采样的简单先验分布，例如均值和方差固定的高斯分布。围绕这一目标，可以设计不同形式的 SDE，使数据分布在连续扩散过程中逐步演化为给定先验分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1b75b016" id="u1b75b016"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6aa271f" id="ub6aa271f">Anderson（1982）的一个重要结论指出：扩散过程的时间反演仍然是一个扩散过程，其动力学由如下逆时间随机微分方程给出</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u53fda684" id="u53fda684" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="11"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22V7ShH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbigl%5B%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)-g(t)%5E2%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cbigr%5Ddt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%2C%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-11">(11)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u67dc5627" id="u67dc5627"><span data-lake-id="u59c2235b" id="u59c2235b">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LSY9S%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0584a583" id="u0584a583">表示时间从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qEyxD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9d891c52" id="u9d891c52">向</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KJiw4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%220%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua89fd360" id="ua89fd360">反向流动时的标准 Wiener 过程，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kBkVw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5ac6c30" id="ua5ac6c30">为无穷小负时间步。获得任意时刻边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pLjmC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9f90711" id="ue9f90711">的得分函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xYDD3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc914dc99" id="uc914dc99">即可数值模拟逆扩散，从先验分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ncZyC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a294a23" id="u1a294a23">生成服从数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oivL7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0f8d6569" id="u0f8d6569">的样本</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u42485ffe" id="u42485ffe"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub01894fc" id="ub01894fc">分布的得分函数可以通过在样本上训练基于得分的模型，并采用 score matching 方法进行估计。为估计</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YYF2W%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f04389f" id="u2f04389f">论文训练一个时间相关的得分模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22agS6A%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)%2C%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4d5cb0e2" id="u4d5cb0e2">其目标函数可以看作对 SMLD 和 DDPM 的连续时间推广</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u946ccef8" id="u946ccef8" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="12"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KSpXM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%20%3D%20%5C%5Carg%5C%5Cmin_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bt%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%20%5C%5Clambda(t)%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%2Ct)%20-%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D.%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-12">(12)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u98bda7ac" id="u98bda7ac"><span data-lake-id="u1e8b2390" id="u1e8b2390">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VVgWU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%3A%5B0%2CT%5D%5C%5Cto%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%7B%3E0%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u37a69703" id="u37a69703">为正权重，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CvR1R%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u764583fa" id="u764583fa">在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22r1Thw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B0%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2435541c" id="u2435541c">均匀采样，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vKfgg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%5C%5Csim%20p_0(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09c9fca7" id="u09c9fca7">，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22suxf4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucac9a65a" id="ucac9a65a">。数据与模型容量充足时，score matching 的最优解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22W3phf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud266185e" id="ud266185e">对几乎所有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22C3PZs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u13b54bb9" id="u13b54bb9">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yAGfG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2236f5d8" id="u2236f5d8">等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GHOQz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D).%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1d16a8f" id="ua1d16a8f">与 SMLD 和 DDPM 类似，通常取</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud1c3af92" id="ud1c3af92" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="13"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22P7rsX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(t)%5C%5Cpropto%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5C%5Cright%5D%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-13">(13)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u181b3839" id="u181b3839"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueec1a86d" id="ueec1a86d" style="color: #101E60">为高效求解，通常需要已知转移核</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uzeO7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)).%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u71c2efae" id="u71c2efae" style="color: #101E60">当</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22waDaf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot%2Ct)%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u072c8116" id="u072c8116" style="color: #101E60">为仿射函数时，该转移核总是高斯分布，其均值和方差通常具有闭式表达，因此可以利用标准方法直接求得</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u24768803" id="u24768803">。对于更一般的 SDE，论文指出，也可以通过求解 Kolmogorov 前向方程来获得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FLEjS%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f9d6ca0" id="u3f9d6ca0">。另一种可行方案是直接模拟 SDE，从条件分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zeRq0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03069c0d" id="u03069c0d">中采样，并在训练时用 sliced score matching 替代去噪 score matching，从而绕开对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MZXE6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua87d730b" id="ua87d730b">的显式计算</span></li></ul><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><h2 id="examples-ve-vp-sdes-and-beyond">🦊 Examples: VE, VP SDEs And Beyond</h2></section><p data-lake-id="ucd7e3920" id="ucd7e3920"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaf55a865" id="uaf55a865">SMLD 与 DDPM 中使用的噪声扰动，都可以看作是两类不同随机微分方程（SDE）的离散化形式。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc6140213" id="uc6140213">对于 SMLD，当采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TGPKY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f3901f9" id="u6f3901f9">个噪声尺度时，每个扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mPq3a%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u593b7921" id="u593b7921">都对应于如下马尔可夫链中变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DeP5J%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7875668c" id="u7875668c">的分布</span></p><p data-lake-id="udce3c5f4" id="udce3c5f4" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="14"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22loFBP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2-%5C%5Csigma_%7Bi-1%7D%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3D1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2CN%2C%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-14">(14)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u02de2558" id="u02de2558"><span data-lake-id="udb61f8a7" id="udb61f8a7">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cFlIn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u985b32e9" id="u985b32e9">。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Vkrls%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e82b815" id="u3e82b815">时，令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tUSOx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_i%3Di%2FN%2C%5C%5Cquad%5C%5CDelta%20t%3D1%2FN%2C%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Csigma_i%3D%5C%5Csigma(t_i)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88a7347a" id="u88a7347a">，以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BFtjd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5CDelta%20t%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20z_%7Bi-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5c02af8" id="ud5c02af8">表示布朗增量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aoUBN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%5C%5Cmathbf%20w_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua42347f4" id="ua42347f4">，在通常的正则条件下，离散马尔可夫链</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hVgCM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ec621d5" id="u0ec621d5">收敛为连续随机过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WoiHI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx(t)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u061f6dff" id="u061f6dff">，其对应的 SDE 为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u50bd1916" id="u50bd1916" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="15"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aOZ6m%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5B%5C%5Csigma%5E2(t)%5D%7D%7Bdt%7D%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-15">(15)</span></p><ul list="ua05d4729-list"><li id="ua05d4729"><span data-lake-id="u0da8dc00" id="u0da8dc00">类似地，对于 DDPM 的扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rxkUK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bp_%7B%5C%5Calpha_i%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BN%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb747c4b" id="udb747c4b">，其离散马尔可夫链写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8cd7b8a8" id="u8cd7b8a8" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="16"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22z9iwj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bz%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20i%3D1%2C%5C%5Ccdots%2CN.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-16">(16)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u9c595009" id="u9c595009"><span data-lake-id="u09ef622a" id="u09ef622a">令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OtCGG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%2C%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cbeta_i%3D%5C%5Cbeta(t_i)%2FN%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77d10aff" id="u77d10aff">，则在通常的正则条件下收敛到如下 SDE</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uee2a4e88" id="uee2a4e88" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="17"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DNr9v%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5C%2Cdt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta(t)%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-17">(17)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua19a4f0c" id="ua19a4f0c"><span data-lake-id="u446d2841" id="u446d2841">因此，SMLD 与 DDPM 所采用的噪声扰动过程，本质上分别对应于两类 SDE 的离散近似。进一步地，论文指出，SMLD 所对应的过程在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GF3B7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73463894" id="u73463894">时方差会不断增大，因此称其为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u307ed063" id="u307ed063">方差爆炸型 SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub983bf7f" id="ub983bf7f">（Variance Exploding, VE SDE）；而 DDPM 在初始分布具有单位方差时，会诱导一个始终保持固定方差的过程，因此称其为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f83986c" id="u7f83986c">方差保持型 SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u40638e81" id="u40638e81">（Variance Preserving, VP SDE）。受 VP SDE 的启发，论文进一步提出一类在似然建模中表现更优的新型 SDE</span></p><p data-lake-id="u92483f47" id="u92483f47" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="18"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Vd5Ka%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5C%5C%2Cdt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5CBigl(1-e%5E%7B-2%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5C%2Cds%7D%5C%5CBigr)%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D.%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-18">(18)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u98feb88e" id="u98feb88e"><span data-lake-id="u3f1946fb" id="u3f1946fb">在使用相同</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x69DW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u696ced13" id="u696ced13">且从相同初始分布出发的条件下，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2bdb0de0" id="u2bdb0de0" style="color: #2A4200">所诱导随机过程的方差在任意中间时刻都被 VP SDE 对应的方差上界所约束</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50ffe92a" id="u50ffe92a">。基于这一性质，论文称为 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4a10e4cd" id="u4a10e4cd">sub-VP SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u27fd4140" id="u27fd4140">。最后，由于 VE、VP 与 sub-VP 三类 SDE 的漂移项都属于仿射形式，其扰动核</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XWfkt%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36311a32" id="u36311a32">均可写成高斯分布，并能够以闭式形式求得，这使得基于连续时间 score matching 训练可以高效实现</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1c37ac52" id="u1c37ac52" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="19"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22i4zlL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%20%5C%5Cmid%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0))%20%3D%20%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%2C%20%5B%5C%5Csigma%5E2(t)%20-%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2(0)%5D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(VE%20SDE)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7De%5E%7B-%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D)%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(VP%20SDE)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(t)%3B%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D%2C%20%5B1%20-%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds%7D%5D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(sub-VP%20SDE)%7D%20%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-19">(19)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue31cc9d2" id="ue31cc9d2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b52782e" id="u6b52782e">SMLD 与 DDPM 的扰动分别是 VE SDE 与 VP SDE 的离散化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua7cd76eb" id="ua7cd76eb">。VE SDE 在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22n4cJh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u97943371" id="u97943371">时方差持续增长，VP SDE 的方差则始终有界。若初始分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22falAZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(x_0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u37225c8c" id="u37225c8c">具有单位方差，VP SDE 在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22omMvW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C%5C%5Cinfty)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u52813662" id="u52813662">上始终保持单位方差不变。由于 VP SDE 的漂移与扩散项均为仿射形式，由 Särkkä 与 Solin 的结果可得协方差随时间演化所满足的常微分方程</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc0334b8b" id="uc0334b8b" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="20"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nLEHg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%7D%7Bdt%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5Cbigl(I-%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%5C%5Cbigr)%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-20">(20)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="uf52208f3" id="uf52208f3"><span data-lake-id="u635f664a" id="u635f664a">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wkmNF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%3A%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCov%7D%5Bx(t)%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77a6ea34" id="u77a6ea34">表示满足 VP SDE 的随机过程</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cvGdY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx(t)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cge%200%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5a38c673" id="u5a38c673">在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LqzYG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17ea2b7c" id="u17ea2b7c">的协方差矩阵。对该方程求解可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue7ae6fb8" id="ue7ae6fb8" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="21"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ih1k4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%20%3D%20I%2Be%5E%7B-%5C%5Cint_0%5Et%20%5C%5Cbeta(s)%5C%5C%2Cds%7D%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(0)-I%5C%5Cbigr).%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-21">(21)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="ua99bb348" id="ua99bb348"><span data-lake-id="u3e1bc742" id="u3e1bc742">只要初始协方差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FsJV7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u38a6c08e" id="u38a6c08e">有界，则任意时刻的协方差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UFm1i%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f6b9068" id="u9f6b9068">也始终保持有界；特别地，当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22E0uZH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(0)%3DI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5d0731b" id="ua5d0731b">时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WGU0g%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CSigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BVP%7D%7D(t)%5C%5Cequiv%20I.%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6ab0e7e" id="ud6ab0e7e">即该过程在整个演化过程中始终保持单位方差。正是基于这一性质差异，论文将 DDPM 对应的过程称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5e487212" id="u5e487212">方差保持型随机微分方程 VP SDE</span></strong></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="BjnWl" id="BjnWl"><span data-lake-id="u72143414" id="u72143414">🐇</span><span data-lake-id="ua843ea46" id="ua843ea46"> Solving The Reverse SDE</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub9d9af9b" id="ub9d9af9b"><span data-lake-id="u5b4fb82e" id="u5b4fb82e">在训练得到时间相关的得分模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GcqGJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc1ff73ae" id="uc1ff73ae">之后，便可以利用该模型构造逆时间 SDE，并通过数值方法对其进行模拟，从而生成服从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OGTLU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf073c79" id="uaf073c79">的样本。由于 SDE 的解析解通常难以直接获得，因此实际生成过程依赖于数值求解器对随机动力学轨迹进行近似。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u75812a64" id="u75812a64">已有大量通用的 SDE 数值求解方法，例如 Euler–Maruyama 方法和随机 Runge–Kutta 方法等，它们本质上对应于对随机动力学过程的不同离散化方式。因此，这些通用数值方法都可以直接应用于逆时间 SDE 的采样过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucd826ae6" id="ucd826ae6">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0f9a1fd7" id="u0f9a1fd7"><span data-lake-id="uafe0ab3e" id="uafe0ab3e">进一步地，论文指出，DDPM 中使用的祖先采样实际上可以看作逆时间 VP SDE 的一种特殊离散化形式。然而，对于新的 SDE，直接推导其对应的祖先采样规则往往并不容易。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucfcb6d8c" id="ucfcb6d8c">为解决这一问题，论文提出逆扩散采样器：其核心思想是在离散化逆时间 SDE 时，采用与前向过程相同的离散化方式，从而可以在已知前向离散形式的基础上直接构造出对应的逆向采样规则</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc5b1124a" id="uc5b1124a"><span data-lake-id="u903ca96d" id="u903ca96d">由于已经获得基于得分的模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RrXVD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u659ae2e0" id="u659ae2e0">因此可以进一步引入基于得分的 MCMC 方法，例如 Langevin MCMC 或 HMC，直接对各时刻的边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x7eGO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c621507" id="u9c621507">进行采样，并据此对数值 SDE 求解器给出的结果进行校正</span></p><p data-lake-id="u940c4a9d" id="u940c4a9d"><span data-lake-id="ucc0b8426" id="ucc0b8426">在每个时间步，数值 SDE 求解器首先给出下一时刻样本的估计，这一过程起到预测器（predictor）的作用；随后，基于得分的 MCMC 方法对估计样本的边缘分布进行修正，起到校正器（corrector）的作用。这一过程与求解方程组常用的预测器—校正器方法类似，故称该采样方法为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufcfbfa09" id="ufcfbfa09">预测器—校正器（Predictor-Corrector, PC）采样器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u503c233d" id="u503c233d">。PC 采样器统一并推广 SMLD 与 DDPM 的采样方式：SMLD 以恒等映射为预测器、退火 Langevin 动力学为校正器；DDPM 以祖先采样为预测器、恒等映射为校正器</span></p><section class="lake-revised-section" id="pc-sampling-typeset"><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="pc-ve-algorithm">
<figcaption id="pc-ve-algorithm"><strong>Algorithm 2</strong> PC Sampling (VE SDE)</figcaption>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{r l l}
1:&amp;\mathbf x_N\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\sigma_{\max}^2\mathbf I)\\[3pt]
2:&amp;\textbf{for }i=N-1,\ldots,0\ \textbf{do}\\[3pt]
3:&amp;\quad\mathbf x'_i\leftarrow\mathbf x_{i+1}+(\sigma_{i+1}^2-\sigma_i^2)s_{\theta^*}(\mathbf x_{i+1},\sigma_{i+1})
 &amp;\triangleright\text{ Predictor}\\[3pt]
4:&amp;\quad\mathbf z\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\mathbf I)\\[3pt]
5:&amp;\quad\mathbf x_i\leftarrow\mathbf x'_i+\sqrt{\sigma_{i+1}^2-\sigma_i^2}\,\mathbf z\\[3pt]
6:&amp;\quad\textbf{for }j=1,\ldots,M\ \textbf{do}
 &amp;\triangleright\text{ Corrector}\\[3pt]
7:&amp;\qquad\mathbf z\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\mathbf I)\\[3pt]
8:&amp;\qquad\mathbf x_i\leftarrow\mathbf x_i+\epsilon_i s_{\theta^*}(\mathbf x_i,\sigma_i)+\sqrt{2\epsilon_i}\,\mathbf z\\[3pt]
&amp;\quad\textbf{end for}\\[3pt]
&amp;\textbf{end for}\\[3pt]
9:&amp;\textbf{return }\mathbf x_0.
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-338%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%20l%20l%7D%5Cn1%3A%26%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_N%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn2%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Di%3DN-1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C0%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn3%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x'_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%2B(%5C%5Csigma_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5E2-%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2)s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%5Cn%20%26%5C%5Ctriangleright%5C%5Ctext%7B%20Predictor%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn4%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn5%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x'_i%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5E2-%5C%5Csigma_i%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn6%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Dj%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CM%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5Cn%20%26%5C%5Ctriangleright%5C%5Ctext%7B%20Corrector%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn7%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn8%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%2B%5C%5Cepsilon_i%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%2C%5C%5Csigma_i)%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Cepsilon_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn9%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_0.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure>
<figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="pc-vp-algorithm">
<figcaption id="pc-vp-algorithm"><strong>Algorithm 3</strong> PC Sampling (VP SDE)</figcaption>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{r l l}
1:&amp;\mathbf x_N\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\mathbf I)\\[3pt]
2:&amp;\textbf{for }i=N-1,\ldots,0\ \textbf{do}\\[3pt]
3:&amp;\quad\mathbf x'_i\leftarrow\left(2-\sqrt{1-\beta_{i+1}}\right)\mathbf x_{i+1}+\beta_{i+1}s_{\theta^*}(\mathbf x_{i+1},i+1)
 &amp;\triangleright\text{ Predictor}\\[3pt]
4:&amp;\quad\mathbf z\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\mathbf I)\\[3pt]
5:&amp;\quad\mathbf x_i\leftarrow\mathbf x'_i+\sqrt{\beta_{i+1}}\,\mathbf z\\[3pt]
6:&amp;\quad\textbf{for }j=1,\ldots,M\ \textbf{do}
 &amp;\triangleright\text{ Corrector}\\[3pt]
7:&amp;\qquad\mathbf z\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\mathbf I)\\[3pt]
8:&amp;\qquad\mathbf x_i\leftarrow\mathbf x_i+\epsilon_i s_{\theta^*}(\mathbf x_i,i)+\sqrt{2\epsilon_i}\,\mathbf z\\[3pt]
&amp;\quad\textbf{end for}\\[3pt]
&amp;\textbf{end for}\\[3pt]
9:&amp;\textbf{return }\mathbf x_0.
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-339%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%20l%20l%7D%5Cn1%3A%26%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_N%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn2%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Di%3DN-1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C0%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn3%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x'_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cleft(2-%5C%5Csqrt%7B1-%5C%5Cbeta_%7Bi%2B1%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%2B%5C%5Cbeta_%7Bi%2B1%7Ds_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%2Ci%2B1)%5Cn%20%26%5C%5Ctriangleright%5C%5Ctext%7B%20Predictor%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn4%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn5%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x'_i%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbeta_%7Bi%2B1%7D%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn6%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Dj%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CM%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5Cn%20%26%5C%5Ctriangleright%5C%5Ctext%7B%20Corrector%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn7%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn8%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%2B%5C%5Cepsilon_i%20s_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E*%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%2Ci)%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Cepsilon_i%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn9%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_0.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure></section><p data-lake-id="udaee48f2" id="udaee48f2"><span data-lake-id="u10023845" id="u10023845">基于得分的模型还提供另一种求解逆时间 SDE 的数值途径。对于任意扩散过程，都存在一个与之对应的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7be6d048" id="u7be6d048">确定性过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaa65b2c6" id="uaa65b2c6">，其轨迹虽然不再具有随机性，但在各个时刻仍与原 SDE 共享相同的边缘概率密度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WDqP8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bp_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%3D0%7D%5E%7BT%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5236cc56" id="u5236cc56">。这一确定性过程满足如下常微分方程</span></p><p data-lake-id="u19dc1256" id="u19dc1256" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="22"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22a0z4I%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20f(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%2Ct)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7Dg(t)%5E2%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%7D%5C%5Clog%20p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cright%5Ddt%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-22">(22)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u39468564" id="u39468564"><span data-lake-id="u3120015c" id="u3120015c">该方程在已知得分函数后即可由原始 SDE 唯一确定。论文称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u51beeddb" id="u51beeddb">概率流常微分方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4874dee7" id="u4874dee7">（probability flow ODE）。当其中的得分函数由时间相关的得分模型近似，而该模型通常取为神经网络时，这一过程便构成神经 ODE 的一个具体实例</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua3d05748" id="ua3d05748"><span data-lake-id="u681737e8" id="u681737e8">在此基础上，论文进一步指出，借助神经 ODE 中的瞬时变量替换公式，可以上式所定义的密度进行显式计算，从而实现对任意输入数据的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u54dbfca3" id="u54dbfca3">精确似然估计。 </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0faa0485" id="u0faa0485">除似然计算外，概率流 ODE 还使得潜在表示操控成为可能。通过上式进行积分，可以将任意数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XDUmr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u09381591" id="u09381591">编码到潜空间中的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bhdjP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(T)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a291412" id="u1a291412">；相应地，再对对应的逆时间 ODE 进行积分，则可以完成解码过程。与其他可逆模型，如神经 ODE 与正规化流类似，这种机制使得模型能够对潜在表示进行操作，从而支持图像插值、温度缩放以及更一般的图像编辑任务</span></p><p data-lake-id="u586c23b4" id="u586c23b4"><span data-lake-id="ua792cbb1" id="ua792cbb1">更进一步地，论文强调，该编码过程具有</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e2764d8" id="u7e2764d8">唯一可识别性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud9a748ab" id="ud9a748ab">。在固定前向 SDE、数据充分、模型容量足够且优化充分的条件下，精确 score 确定相应的概率流 ODE；在解唯一的条件下，同一起点产生确定的编码轨迹。概率流 ODE 与前向 SDE 在各时刻具有相同的边缘分布，但二者的样本轨迹并不相同</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5e5b718e" id="u5e5b718e"><span data-lake-id="ucd29c08f" id="ucd29c08f">最后，在采样方面，论文表明也可以通过求解上式从不同的终态条件</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IkPs4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(T)%5C%5Csim%20p_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub114f37f" id="ub114f37f">出发生成</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HnB9L%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D(0)%5C%5Csim%20p_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e3c00b1" id="u3e3c00b1">的样本。采用固定离散化策略时，概率流 ODE 已能够生成具有竞争力的样本，尤其是在与校正器结合使用时效果更佳。若进一步采用黑盒 ODE 求解器，则不仅能够生成高质量样本，还能够显式控制采样精度与计算效率之间的权衡</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="GWWzi" id="GWWzi"><span data-lake-id="ue6c6c2fc" id="ue6c6c2fc">🍄</span><span data-lake-id="u37953c33" id="u37953c33"> SDEs In The Wild</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue7fdfa70" id="ue7fdfa70"><strong><span data-lake-id="u171d8946" id="u171d8946" style="color: #70000D">VE SDE、VP SDE 与 sub-VP SDE 的具体实例化形式，说明它们如何分别对应 SMLD、DDPM 及论文实验中使用的 sub-VP 模型</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u533fe113" id="u533fe113"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1e06d68" id="uc1e06d68">对于 SMLD，噪声尺度</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nPiNP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EN%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8be6f3c9" id="u8be6f3c9">通常取为几何序列，连续极限下有</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ua4f32267" id="ua4f32267" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="23"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22a2nem%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Et%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-23">(23)</span></p><ul list="u9890b8bc"><li fid="ud4e0271f" data-lake-id="u657c4f4e" id="u657c4f4e"><span data-lake-id="u638cffda" id="u638cffda">对应的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u17b3345b" id="u17b3345b">VE SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud0d9c7a9" id="ud0d9c7a9"> 为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud908f420" id="ud908f420" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="24"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RW6Ev%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5Et%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%7D%5C%5C%2Cdw%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1%5D%2C%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-24">(24)</span></p><ul list="u5fea8856"><li fid="uef65a1f8" data-lake-id="ue2187b09" id="ue2187b09"><span data-lake-id="u4ea72279" id="u4ea72279">从给定初值出发、不额外注入初始噪声时，该连续 SDE 的精确扰动核为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u09e5e64a" id="u09e5e64a" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="25"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jB99u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20x(t)%3Bx(0)%2C%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5E2%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B2t%7D-1%5C%5Cright%5DI%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-25">(25)</span></p><ul list="u492d82d7"><li fid="u7b2e0a44" data-lake-id="uc0dc701e" id="uc0dc701e"><span data-lake-id="u4e103deb" id="u4e103deb">这里的条件方差在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rzcLo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb1446d9" id="ucb1446d9">时必须为零。原论文实现直接按几何尺度扰动数据，其方差还包含初始噪声尺度的平方，与上述精确 SDE 转移核的约定不同。为避开零方差端点，实际计算通常将时间区间限制为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wgDJI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub7e86b63" id="ub7e86b63"><strong><span data-lake-id="u36cee1ea" id="u36cee1ea">对于 DDPM，离散噪声参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WDj3X%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Cbeta_i%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ude426704" id="ude426704">通常取为等差序列。在连续极限下</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u0b55fe7e" id="u0b55fe7e" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="26"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LRxWk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%3D%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%2Bt(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-26">(26)</span></p><ul list="ua2bc3a30"><li fid="uc78af4bf" data-lake-id="ua73a7b75" id="ua73a7b75"><span data-lake-id="u15c01865" id="u15c01865">由此得到具体的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u47f9eaa6" id="u47f9eaa6">VP SDE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u031d496f" id="u031d496f"></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ucfed2958" id="ucfed2958" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="27"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nfqfb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cfrac12%5C%5Cbigl(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%2Bt(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)%5C%5Cbigr)x%5C%5C%2Cdt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%2Bt(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)%7D%5C%5C%2Cdw%2C%20%5C%5Cqquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-27">(27)</span></p><ul list="u30de85ab"><li fid="uc1728ca0" data-lake-id="u192e5322" id="u192e5322"><span data-lake-id="uae368d9d" id="uae368d9d">其扰动核为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u05c34e7a" id="u05c34e7a" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="28"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LjAxV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20x(t)%3B%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac14%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7Dx(0)%2C%5C%5C%2C%20I-Ie%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-28">(28)</span></p><ul list="u0729777f"><li fid="u3812b7a1" data-lake-id="u70e2bed1" id="u70e2bed1"><span data-lake-id="ufd47542b" id="ufd47542b">VP SDE 的扰动核在初始时刻也退化为给定初值；由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vYQ2h%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cto0%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33d5046a" id="u33d5046a">时方差趋近于 0，训练和采样时同样会将时间限制在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22C45in%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u33eaf4c8" id="u33eaf4c8"><strong><span data-lake-id="ube201744" id="ube201744">对于 sub-VP SDE，论文采用与 VP SDE 相同的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CqFcp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9011401b" id="u9011401b">，它与 VP SDE 具有相同的均值衰减形式，但方差更受控制，因此通常在似然建模和样本质量上都更有优势。其扰动核进一步改写为</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u14b2bbfe" id="u14b2bbfe" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="KMj1j" data-equation-number="29"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RLJlK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B0t%7D(x(t)%5C%5Cmid%20x(0))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%20x(t)%3B%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac14%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7Dx(0)%2C%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%201-e%5E%7B-%5C%5Cfrac12%20t%5E2(%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D-%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D)-t%5C%5Cbar%5C%5Cbeta_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%5E2%20I%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2C1%5D.%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-KMj1j-29">(29)</span></p>